  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterTutor3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Hi.
  - Hey. Thanks for actually saying hi today. Should I take that as a compliment?
  - Ew. No. Especially considering you stink. Go shower.
  - "Unlike some people, I spent three hours running around a factory with a gun.
    But I\u2019m still curious\u2014why\u2019d you come over?"
  - ' A few days ago you snapped at me just for trying to talk.'
  - " I didn\u2019t come to talk."
  - I observed your performance and supervised the entire team. And I have comments
    for you specifically.
  - "If that\u2019s just an excuse to start a conversation, then go on."
  - " Your behavior was unacceptable. Everyone listened to what I said, except you
    \u2014 you charged in headfirst. We operate QUIETLY."
  - "So we don\u2019t get wiped out because someone thinks they can single-handedly
    save the day. Because of your actions, Ferret had to patch you up. All over."
  - "And? Are you, like, worried? About your \u201Cteammates\u2019\u201D lives?"
  - "Um\u2026No\u2026 This is a reprimand."
  - "Anyway, um\u2026 I\u2019m throwing out all your cigarettes for that. Stop putting
    your coworkers at risk."
  - "Uh-huh\u2026 okay?"
  - "Though they could\u2019ve shot Ferret. Or your brother."
  - "They would\u2019ve gotten shot not because they were reckless. I\u2019m emphasizing
    your\u2026 ridiculous behavior."
  - "You\u2019re flustered, aren\u2019t you?"
  - What?! No. Gross. Go shower. You and Mister Beast
  - "\u2014 I mean Beast"
  - "\u2014 are exhausting."
  - "Got it, got it. I won\u2019t put the \u201Cteam\u201D at risk."
  - "Especially the \u201Ctwitchy ones.\u201D Heh."
